# PCB Defect Detection using YOLOv8( Methodology)

## Problem Statement

Manual PCB inspection is slow, expensive and error-prone.

## Proposed Solution

Develop an AI-based automatic PCB defect detection system using YOLOv8.

## Features

- Detects six PCB defects
- Real-time detection
- Lightweight YOLOv8n model
- ONNX deployment support

## Dataset

DeepPCB Dataset

Classes

- Open Circuit
- Short
- Mouse Bite
- Spur
- Pin Hole
- Spurious Copper

